  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "在空房间的一角，有一面白色裸墙，地板为天然原木。阳光从一侧照射进来。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "餐桌上方是一盏KNIXHULT 克尼斯胡特，充满仪式感。墙壁旁有一个深色玻璃门柜，里面存放着餐桌用具。"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c8/d7/c8d7905bd6f4cdfe67ddb12f56f331a6.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/eb/ef/ebef8a844a89f89000ab28a875bf5635.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c8/d7/c8d7905bd6f4cdfe67ddb12f56f331a6.jpg",
     "text": ""
